title: The Nationalities Of The Empire
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
max-visits: 36
is-card: true
card-image: img/volker.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs

= Campaigning

Many different nationalities exist in the empire. We can campaign among them to increase our support outside of the German people.

- @hungary: The Hungarians, mostly residing in the territories of the kingdom of Hungary and Vienna.
- @yugoslav: The southern slavs in Carinthia and the southern regions of the empire
- @italy: The italians that mostly live in the regions of South Tyrol and Trentino. These regions have been promised to the Kingdom Of Italy by the Entente in the treaty of London.
- @czech: Czech and Slovak people, who live mostly in the German speaking regions of Bohemia. 
- @german: No, we must become a party for purely the German people
- @root: Let´s decide this at another time.
- @easy_discard

@hungary
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: burgenland_support += 1; workers_sdap_hun += 8*(1-dissent); new_middle_sdap_hun += 2; catholics_sdap_hun += 2; unemployed_sdap_hun += 6; workers_sdap_hun -= 1 if unemployed >= 25; workers_sdap_hun += 2 if year = 1918; workers_sdap_hun += 3*(1-dissent) if republic = 1 and year <= 1919; workers_sdap_hun += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress >= 1; new_middle_sdap_hun += 2 if peoples_party > 0; old_middle_sdap_hun += 2 if peoples_party > 0; catholics_sdap_hun += 1 if peoples_party > 1; resources -= 1;

We have increased our campaigning among the workers. [? if unemployed >= 15: The high levels of unemployment make our campaign more difficult. ?][? if republic = 1 and year >1920: The populance is . ?]

@new_middle
