We have increased our campaigning among the new middle class. [? if socialism <= 49 and peoples_party == 0: The popular antipathy towards socialism among this group makes our campaign more difficult. ?] [? if peoples_party > 0: As a people's party, we have an easier time increasing support among the middle class than before. ?] [? if republic = 1 and year >1920: the proclaimation of the new republic has made our campaigning effotrt easier. ?]

